    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you awoke in a dark, sealed room, you were the last surviving fairy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But soon, you meet the little fairy, Sir Leonardo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And so, an adventure to uncover the world's secrets begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/a87fc4581c7771c5af4853a42700711e.poster.webp?t=1751537301\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/a87fc4581c7771c5af4853a42700711e.webp?t=1751537301\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet humans showing hostility, giant robots, and others living through the apocalypse, each with their own story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your choices will decide their fate and the direction of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>(Sorry, we haven't localized this gif yet! We'll try to update it when we have time!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/9c92803c68045542d7346a1f074fc428.poster.webp?t=1751537301\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/9c92803c68045542d7346a1f074fc428.webp?t=1751537301\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey through barren wastelands and human caves, towards the truth hidden in the old kingdom at the end of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/85d0cea9c8794766302df58041df9257.poster.webp?t=1751537301\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/85d0cea9c8794766302df58041df9257.webp?t=1751537301\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet companions and helpers, collect various weapons, and fight against the enemies who stand in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/58239789649bcd06c92ebe14d755b4f9.poster.webp?t=1751537301\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/58239789649bcd06c92ebe14d755b4f9.webp?t=1751537301\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 A Dark Fairytale, Drawn in Pixel Art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a top-down world rendered in pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a deep narrative that uncovers the secrets of a fallen race and a collapsing world, hidden behind a seemingly cheerful atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 The Enigmatic Companion, 'Sir Leonardo'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your only friend who helps you is the little fairy, Leonardo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, a legend of another, greater 'Sir Leonardo' exists in this world\u2014one you do not know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Diverse Combat Styles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Any weapon you've touched can be summoned at will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summon swords, bows, and various other weapons to suit the situation, cast spells, and activate runes to create your own combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 A Fate Forged by Your Choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The fates of characters, the future of the world, and the story's ending will change based on your choices and decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What kind of ending will you face?<strong>     </strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you awoke in a dark, sealed room, you were the last surviving fairy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But soon, you meet the little fairy, Sir Leonardo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And so, an adventure to uncover the world's secrets begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/a87fc4581c7771c5af4853a42700711e.poster.webp?t=1751537301\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/a87fc4581c7771c5af4853a42700711e.webp?t=1751537301\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet humans showing hostility, giant robots, and others living through the apocalypse, each with their own story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your choices will decide their fate and the direction of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>(Sorry, we haven't localized this gif yet! We'll try to update it when we have time!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/9c92803c68045542d7346a1f074fc428.poster.webp?t=1751537301\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/9c92803c68045542d7346a1f074fc428.webp?t=1751537301\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey through barren wastelands and human caves, towards the truth hidden in the old kingdom at the end of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/85d0cea9c8794766302df58041df9257.poster.webp?t=1751537301\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/85d0cea9c8794766302df58041df9257.webp?t=1751537301\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet companions and helpers, collect various weapons, and fight against the enemies who stand in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/58239789649bcd06c92ebe14d755b4f9.poster.webp?t=1751537301\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/58239789649bcd06c92ebe14d755b4f9.webp?t=1751537301\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 A Dark Fairytale, Drawn in Pixel Art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a top-down world rendered in pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a deep narrative that uncovers the secrets of a fallen race and a collapsing world, hidden behind a seemingly cheerful atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 The Enigmatic Companion, 'Sir Leonardo'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your only friend who helps you is the little fairy, Leonardo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, a legend of another, greater 'Sir Leonardo' exists in this world\u2014one you do not know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 Diverse Combat Styles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Any weapon you've touched can be summoned at will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summon swords, bows, and various other weapons to suit the situation, cast spells, and activate runes to create your own combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6 A Fate Forged by Your Choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The fates of characters, the future of the world, and the story's ending will change based on your choices and decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What kind of ending will you face?<strong>     </strong></p>",
